<mjml><mj-head><mj-attributes><mj-all font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" /><mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" color="#2A2F42" padding="8px 0" /></mj-attributes><mj-preview>Internal test — confirming the EchoSphere email system delivers.</mj-preview></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#F4F6FB"><mj-section padding="24px 0 8px 0"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-size="20px" font-weight="bold" color="#7B4ED6">EchoSphere</mj-text><mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" letter-spacing="1px" color="#9AA3B8">INTERNAL TEST EMAIL</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#ffffff" border-radius="12px" padding="16px 24px"><mj-column><mj-text>Hi {{first_name}},</mj-text><mj-text>This is a test email from the IPMD Email Management System. If you're reading this, delivery, rendering, and tracking are all working end-to-end.</mj-text><mj-text>Nothing to action here — you're on the internal test list.</mj-text><mj-text>Thanks for helping us test 💜<br />— The EchoSphere Team</mj-text><mj-button href="https://example.com" background-color="#7B4ED6" color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" border-radius="8px" padding="24px 0 8px 0" inner-padding="14px 28px">Sample button (test link) →</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>